WEBVTT

00:00:00.657 --> 00:00:01.661
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Are we</b> late?

00:00:04.652 --> 00:00:06.041
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>you are</b>.

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:10.570
No, <b>you aren’t</b>.

00:00:13.544 --> 00:00:14.912
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Are you</b> from Russia?

00:00:17.887 --> 00:00:18.998
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>we are</b>.

00:00:21.983 --> 00:00:23.366
No, <b>we aren’t</b>.

00:00:26.351 --> 00:00:27.466
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Are they</b> Mexican?

00:00:30.483 --> 00:00:31.841
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>they are</b>.

00:00:34.829 --> 00:00:36.286
No, <b>they aren’t</b>.